  (text "3V3_C6 isolation/tuning link is implemented once in 02_POWER_3V3 (FB_C6). Do not duplicate it here." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 132 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "e50000a8-5555-4555-8555-0000000000a9"))
  (text "SDIO pull-ups: CMD + DAT0..3 = 51.1k to 3V3_C6. CLK has no pull-up. Series: CLK=22R, others=0R initial." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 137 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "e50000a9-5555-4555-8555-0000000000aa"))
  (text "C6 recovery remains independent of P4: UART0 TX/RX + GPIO8/GPIO9 + EN are exported to service/debug sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 142 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "e50000aa-5555-4555-8555-0000000000ab"))
  (text "RF: place module antenna at PCB edge; preserve official footprint keep-out on every copper layer. If enclosure blocks antenna, switch to WROOM-1U before PCB freeze." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 35 147 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "e50000ab-5555-4555-8555-0000000000ac"))
